==Finnish==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|fi|komia||dialectal}}

===Etymology===
Thought to be expressive in some way; perhaps related to {{m|fi|kumea}} in which case the word may originally have referred to voice. Related to {{cog|krl|komie}} and {{cog|vot|komõa}}.

